# site/_headers
# Response headers for dses.ai, served by Cloudflare Pages.
#
# TAKES EFFECT ONLY UNDER A WRANGLER-BASED DEPLOY OF THIS DIRECTORY.
# Cloudflare Pages reads _headers from the root of the uploaded output
# directory. A dashboard Direct Upload of a lone index.html does not carry
# this file, and none of the headers below will be present. See
# docs/DEPLOY-dses-site.md at the repository root.
#
# The CSP is sized to what the page actually loads, verified against the
# v0.2.0-rc8 source:
#   one inline <style> block and five style attributes -> style-src 'unsafe-inline'
#   fonts.googleapis.com stylesheet                    -> style-src host
#   fonts.gstatic.com font files                       -> font-src host
#   zero scripts, zero images, zero frames, zero forms
# script-src stays 'none' because the site loads no script at all. If
# analytics or any other script is ever added to this zone, script-src has to
# be widened here in the same change or the script will be blocked.
#
# HSTS carries includeSubDomains, so it will also bind verify.dses.ai once
# that subdomain exists. That is intended. No preload directive: preloading is
# hard to reverse and is a separate decision.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'none'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
